-color:${nRest ? 'var(--warn,#b45309)' : 'var(--ok,#16a34a)'}\">\n        <strong class=\"${nRest ? 'warn' : 'ok'}\">${nRest}</strong><span>Grant(s) encore en attente</span></div>`\n    : `<div class=\"stat-tile bento-span-4\"><strong class=\"muted\">→</strong><span>File grants · section ci-dessous</span></div>`;\n  const tiles = `<div class=\"stat-tile bento-span-4\" style=\"border-color:${ok ? 'var(--ok,#16a34a)' : 'var(--warn,#b45309)'}\">\n      <strong class=\"${ok ? 'ok' : 'warn'}\">${verdict}</strong><span>Accès document · tiroir</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat-tile bento-span-4\"><strong>${doc}</strong><span>Pièce concernée</span></div>\n    <div class=\"stat-tile bento-span-4\"><strong>${who}</strong><span>${esc(duree)} · ${notePart}</span></div>\n    ${restTile}`;\n  showEntToast(\n    `<strong>${ok ? 'Grant accordé' : 'Grant refusé'}</strong>`\n    + `<div class=\"bento\" style=\"margin:.4rem 0 0\">${tiles}</div>`\n    + `<p style=\"margin:.35rem 0 0;font-size:.85rem\">${fiche}`\n    + `<a href=\"/app/etab\">Établissement</a> · file actualisée</p>`,\n    9000,\n  );\n}\n\n/** États vides staff (internat, infirmerie…) — même densité que famille, sans toucher famEmptyDense. */\nfunction staffEmptyDense(title, bullets, actionsHtml) {\n  const list = (bullets || []).filter(Boolean);\n  const ul = list.length\n    ? `<ul style=\"margin:.45rem 0 0;padding-left:1.1rem;color:var(--muted,#6e6e73);font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.45\">${list.map(b => `<li>${b}</li>`).join('')}</ul>`\n    : '';\n  const acts = actionsHtml\n    ? `<div class=\"row\" style=\"margin-top:.65rem;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center\">${actionsHtml}</div>`\n    : '';\n  return `<div class=\"empty empty-state\" style=\"text-align:left;margin:.5rem 0;padding:.75rem .85rem\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-weight:600\">${esc(title)}</p>${ul}${acts}\n  </div>`;\n}\n\n/** Journal modif élève (staff dossier) — bento + listes par domaine. */\nfunction staffJournalModifDenseHtml(list) {\n  const items = list || [];\n  if (!items.length) {\n    return {\n      stats: '',\n      body: staffEmptyDense('Aucune entrée journal', [\n        'Les modifications métier (classe, documents, vie scolaire…) s’affichent ici au fil des actions staff.',\n        'Les entrées marquées « famille » sont visibles sur le portail parent / élève.',\n      ], ''),\n    };\n  }\n  const byDom = {};\n  let nFam = 0;\n  items.forEach(j => {\n    const d = j.domaine || 'autre';\n    byDom[d] = (byDom[d] || 0) + 1;\n    if (j.visible_famille) nFam += 1;\n  });\n  const domKeys = Object.keys(byDom).sort();\n  const stats = `<div class=\"bento\" style=\"margin-bottom:.55rem\">\n    <div class=\"stat-tile bento-span-3\"><strong>${items.length}</strong><span>Entrées</span></div>\n    <div class=\"stat-tile bento-span-3\"><strong>${nFam}</strong><span>Visibles famille</span></div>\n    ${domKeys.slice(0, 2).map(k =>\n      `<div class=\"stat-tile bento-span-3\"><strong>${byDom[k]}</strong><span>${esc(k)}</span></div>`\n    ).join('')}\n  </div>`;\n  const groups = {};\n  items.forEach(j => {\n    const d = j.domaine || 'autre';\n    if (!groups[d]) groups[d] = [];\n    groups[d].push(j);\n  });\n  const body = domKeys.map(dom => {\n    const slice = groups[dom].slice(0, 15);\n    const rows = slice.map(j => {\n      const when = esc((j.created_at || '').slice(0, 16));\n      const act = esc(j.action || '—');\n      const fam = j.visible_famille\n        ? '<span class=\"pill ok\">famille</span>'\n        : '<span class=\"pill\">interne</span>';\n      return `<li style=\"margin:.32rem 0;line-height:1.4\">\n        <strong>${esc(j.libelle)}</strong>\n        <span class=\"muted\"> · ${when} · ${act}</span> ${fam}\n      </li>`;\n    }).join('');\n    const extra = groups[dom].length > 15\n      ? `<li class=\"muted\">… ${groups[dom].length - 15} autre(s) dans ${esc(dom)}</li>`\n      : '';\n    return `<h4 style=\"margin:.85rem 0 .35rem;font-size:.92rem\">${esc(dom)}</h4>\n      <ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:1.1rem\">${rows}${extra}</ul>`;\n  }).join('');\n  return { stats, body };\n}\n\nfunction isStaffHomeDirectionFlux() {\n  return path() === '/app' && ((me && me.role) || '') === 'direction';\n}\n\n/** Accueil direction — priorités du jour (avant cockpit KPI). */\nfunction homeDirectionTipDenseHtml(stats) {\n  if (!isStaffHomeDirectionFlux()) return '';\n  const st = stats || {};\n  const nRh = Number(st.nRh) || 0;\n  const nGrants = Number(st.nGrants) || 0;\n  const nAbs = Number(st.nAbs) || 0;\n  const nAlertUrgent = Number(st.nAlertUrgent) || 0;\n  const nIns = Number(st.nIns) || 0;\n  const campOuverte = !!st.campOuverte;\n  const campLabel = st.campLabel ? esc(String(st.campLabel)) : 'N+1';\n  return `<div class=\"bento\" style=\"margin:0 0 .55rem\">\n    <a class=\"stat-tile bento-span-4\" href=\"/app/rh\" style=\"text-decoration:none;border-color:${nRh ? 'var(--warn,#b45309)' : 'var(--border,#e5e5ea)'}\">\n      <strong class=\"${nRh ? 'warn' : ''}\">${nRh}</strong><span>Absence(s) RH à valider</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"stat-tile bento-span-4\" href=\"/app/etab\" style=\"text-decoration:none;border-color:${nGrants ? 'var(--warn,#b45309)' : 'var(--border,#e5e5ea)'}\">\n      <strong class=\"${nGrants ? 'warn' : ''}\">${nGrants}</strong><span>Grant(s) document</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"stat-tile bento-span-4\" href=\"/app/absences\" style=\"text-decoration:none;border-color:${nAbs ? 'var(--accent,#0071e3)' : 'var(--border,#e5e5ea)'}\">\n      <strong>${nAbs}</strong><span>Absence(s) VS à traiter</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"stat-tile bento-span-4\" href=\"/app/reinscription\" style=\"text-decoration:none\">\n      <strong class=\"${campOuverte ? 'warn' : ''}\">${campOuverte ? 'Ouverte' : 'Fermée'}</strong><span>Campagne ${campLabel}</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"stat-tile bento-span-4\" href=\"/app/inscriptions\" style=\"text-decoration:none\">\n      <strong>${nIns}</strong><span>Dossiers inscription</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"stat-tile bento-span-4\" href=\"/app/alertes?sev=urgent\" style=\"text-decoration:none;border-color:${nAlertUrgent ? 'var(--warn,#b45309)' : 'var(--border,#e5e5ea)'}\">\n      <strong class=\"${nAlertUrgent ? 'warn' : ''}\">${nAlertUrgent}</strong><span>Alerte(s) CPE urgentes</span>\n    </a>\n  </div>`;\n}\n\nfunction homeDirReinscDenseHtml(camp, montee, exigences) {\n  const cands = (montee && montee.candidats) || [];\n  const nCand = montee && montee.count != null ? montee.count : cands.length;\n  const nConfirm = cands.filter(x => String(x.statut || '') === 'reinscription').length;\n  const nAttente = Math.max(0, nCand - nConfirm);\n  const nExig = (exigences || []).length;\n  const ouverte = !!(camp && (camp.ouverte === true || camp.ouverte === 1));\n  const annee = camp && camp.annee_cible ? esc(camp.annee_cible) : 'N+1';\n  const acompte = camp ? euros(camp.acompte_centimes || 0) : '—';\n  const nivSrc = montee ? esc(montee.niveau_source || '4e') : '4e';\n  const nivCible = montee ? esc(montee.niveau_cible || '3e') : '3e';\n  if (!camp) {\n    return '<p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0\">Aucune campagne N+1 — <a href=\"/app/reinscription\">ouvrir la campagne</a>.</p>';\n  }\n  return `\n    <a class=\"stat-tile bento-span-4\" href=\"/app/reinscription\"><strong class=\"${ouverte ? 'warn' : ''}\">${ouverte ? 'Ouverte' : 'Fermée'}</strong><span>Campagne ${annee}</span></a>\n    <a class=\"stat-tile bento-span-4\" href=\"/app/reinscription\"><strong>${acompte}</strong><span>Acompte N+1</span></a>\n    <a class=\"stat-tile bento-span-4\" href=\"/app/reinscription\"><strong>${nCand}</strong><span>Montée ${nivSrc} → ${nivCible}</span></a>\n    <a class=\"stat-tile bento-span-4\" href=\"/app/reinscription\"><strong class=\"${nConfirm ? 'ok' : ''}\">${nConfirm}</strong><span>Réinscriptions confirmées</span></a>\n    <a class=\"stat-tile bento-span-4\" href=\"/app/reinscription\"><strong class=\"${nAttente ? 'warn' : ''}\">${nAttente}</strong><span>En attente famille</span></a>\n    <a class=\"stat-tile bento-span-4\" href=\"/app/reinscription\"><strong>${nExig}</strong><span>Documents exigés</span></a>`;\n}\n\nfunction homeInscPiecesSpotlightTile(insPieces, spanClass) {\n  const list = insPieces || [];\n  if (!list.length) return '';\n  let hit = list.find(s => {\n    const lab = String(s.eleve_label || '').toLowerCase();\n    return lab.includes('cedric') || lab.includes('diggory');\n  });\n  if (!hit) hit = list[0];\n  if (!hit) return '';\n  const lab = String(hit.eleve_label || 'Inscription').trim();\n  const short = lab.split(/\\s+/).slice(0, 2).join(' ') || 'Élève';\n  const motif = hit.motif_code ? ` · ${hit.motif_code}` : '';\n  const n = list.length;\n  const spanLbl = n > 1\n    ? `${esc(short)} · pièces (+${n - 1})${esc(motif)}`\n    : `${esc(short)} · pièces${esc(motif)}`;\n  const span = spanClass || 'bento-span-2';\n  return `<a class=\"stat-tile ${span}\" href=\"/app/inscriptions?etape=pieces\"><strong class=\"warn\">${n}</strong><span>${spanLbl}</span></a>`;\n}\n\nconst PTS_VS_SEUIL_BAS = 8;\n\nfunction isPtsVsSoldeBas(pts) {\n  if (!pts || pts.solde == null) return false;\n  const depart = Number(pts.depart != null ? pts.depart : 20);\n  const solde = Number(pts.solde);\n  if (!Number.isFinite(solde) || !Number.isFinite(depart)) return false;\n  const rel = Math.ceil(depart * 0.75);\n  return solde < depart && solde <= Math.max(PTS_VS_SEUIL_BAS, rel);\n}\n\nasync function snapshotPermisBasEleves(eleveIds) {\n  const uniq = [...new Set((eleveIds || []).filter(Boolean))];\n  if (!uniq.length) return [];\n  const map = await loadPointsVsByEleve(uniq);\n  const hits = [];\n  for (const eid of uniq) {\n    const p = map[eid];\n    if (!isPtsVsSoldeBas(p)) continue;\n    hits.push({\n      eid,\n      solde: p.solde,\n      depart: p.depart != null ? p.depart : 20,\n    });\n  }\n  if (hits.length) await hydrateEleveNames(hits.map(h => h.eid));\n  hits.sort((a, b) => Number(a.solde) - Number(b.solde));\n  return hits.map(h => ({\n    ...h,\n    label: ELEVE_NAME_CACHE[h.eid] || h.eid.slice(0, 8),\n  }));\n}\n\nfunction toastCommissionCreee(payload) {\n  const p = payload || {};\n  const href = absencesComDeepLink({\n    comId: p.comId,\n    dosId: p.dosId,\n    eleveId: p.eleveId,\n  });\n  const who = p.eleveLabel\n    ? esc(p.eleveLabel)\n    : (p.dosId ? 'Dossier convoqué' : 'Commission planifiée');\n  const jour = p.jour ? ` · ${esc(String(p.jour))}` : '';\n  const heure = p.heure ? ` · ${esc(String(p.heure))}` : '';\n  const objet = p.objet && !p.eleveLabel ? ` · ${esc(String(p.objet).trim())}` : '';\n  const ref = p.comId ? ` · ${esc(String(p.comId).slice(0, 8))}` : '';\n  const links = [];\n  if (p.dosId) links.push(`<a href=\"${esc(href)}\">Ouvrir le dossier</a>`);\n  links.push(`<a href=\"${esc(href || '/app/absences')}\">Absences &amp; commissions</a>`);\n  links.push('<a href=\"/app/absences#absComPanel\">Panneau commission</a>');\n  showEntToast(\n    `<strong>Commission créée</strong> — ${who}${jour}${heure}${objet}${ref}. ${links.join(' · ')}`,\n    11000,\n  );\n}\n\nfunction toastCommissionDecidee(d, meta) {\n  const m = meta || {};\n  const lib = esc((d && d.decision_libelle) || m.decision_texte || 'Décision');\n  const ptsRaw = d && d.points_retires != null\n    ? d.points_retires\n    : (m.points_retires != null ? m.points_retires : null);\n  const pts = ptsRaw != null ? esc(String(ptsRaw)) : '—';\n  const whoRaw = (d && d.eleve_label) || m.eleveLabel || '';\n  const who = whoRaw ? esc(String(whoRaw).trim()) : '—';\n  const tiles = `<div class=\"stat-tile bento-span-4\" style=\"border-color:var(--accent,#0071e3)\">\n      <strong>${lib}</strong><span>Décision commission</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat-tile bento-span-4\"><strong class=\"warn\">−${pts}</strong><span>Points permis VS</span></div>\n    <div class=\"stat-tile bento-span-4\"><strong>${who}</strong><span>Élève · registre actualisé</span></div>`;\n  showEntToas